<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>Cazic Thule (Sea Tea) Owned!</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>11/27/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3"><img src="/lotd/images/ct%2Dnov27%2Ejpg" width="400" height="300" align="left">Server reset means big mobs for most guilds.  Sea Tea was our target and took him down with no wipeouts.<BR><BR>Drops:<BR>Two Cloak of the Fearsomes - Baram and Xantar<BR>and <BR>Two Bile Etched Obsidian Chokers - Jenguran and Slashu</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>Statue down :)</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>11/14/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3"><img src="/lotd/images/stat%2Dnov14%2Ejpg" width="400" height="300" align="left">Statue again.<BR><BR>Drops:<BR><BR>BP of Eradication - Xantar<BR>2 - Reavers - Slashu and Aenarion<BR>Iron Scroll of War - Talruum</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>Xygoz Down our third VP dragon!</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>11/11/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3"><img src="/lotd/images/xygos%2Ejpg" width="400" height="300" align="left">Back in VP today we wanted to see some new dragons.  We saw Xygoz and had to take him down with a Lava Drake add :)<BR><BR>Take a look at <a href="http://members.shaw.ca/eq-hansol2">Lords of the Dragon  Nov 10/11 VP adventure!</a> if you don't believe me! :)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>Hoshkar down, one of the harder VP dragons Owned!</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>11/10/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3"><img src="/lotd/images/hosh%2Dnov10%2Ejpg" width="400" height="300" align="left">Entering VP agian tonight to kill some dragons.  Killing Silverwing, and we finally took down Hoshkar with a Guardian Wurm add!!!! Very nice battle.  34 people, 4 deaths on hosh.<BR><BR>Take a look at <a href="http://members.shaw.ca/eq-hansol2">Lords of the Dragon  Nov 10/11 VP adventure!</a> if you dont belive me! :)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>Kael Trio:  Statue/Vind!</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>11/08/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3"><img src="/lotd/images/stat%2Dmooch%2Ejpg" width="400" height="300" align="left">We killed Statue to see how we could do after the recent patch and for those who thought we Zerg everything you can think again.  <BR><BR>Statue drops:<BR>Iron Scroll of War <BR>Hammer of Battle <BR>Swiftblade of Zek <BR><BR>Vind Drops:<BR>Boots of the Vindicator <BR>New Necro spell</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>Kael Trio:  King Tormax</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>11/08/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3"><img src="/lotd/images/tormax%2Ejpg" width="400" height="300" align="left">Tormax down, a first for our guild and it was fun as hell! :)<BR><BR>Tormax Drops:<BR>Ring of Lightning <BR>Velium Encrusted Gauntlets<BR>White Dragon Scale Sash <BR>Tormax's Head</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>Silverwing again :)</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>11/03/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3"><img src="/lotd/images/swzenor%2Ejpg" width="400" height="300" align="left">Killed silverwing today, droped a nice weapon and good looking chanter robe, Gratz Zenor :)<BR><BR>Hosh your next!  :)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>Double vision?  2 Traks?</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>10/29/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3">Yes thats right, Sunday night Trakanon was killed.....20 minutes later people in seb started giveing us tells saying Trakanon was shouting in the zone.  Well sure enough the GM spawned 2 Traks, most likely because of the halloween events.  One dead Trakanon and one Trakanon charging in <a href="http://members.shaw.ca/eq-hansol/2trak.jpg">this shot</a> :)<BR><BR>Was a hell of a time and I am sure for our monks getting the prot and the traks seperated :)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>Statue fun :)</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>10/23/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3"><img src="/lotd/images/stat2%2Ejpg" width="320" height="240" align="left">Today was a big day for alot of guilds, Big mobs too.  Today was the day for Statue/Vind for some tank loot.  We actually got statue as a surprise and fought him anyways and won :)<BR><BR>Drops were:<BR><BR>Vindi:<BR>-Boots of the Vindicator <BR><BR>Statue:<BR>-Cloak of the Falling Stars <BR>-Hammer of Battle <BR>-Iron Scroll of War</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>CT again :)</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>10/16/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3">The title says enough :)<BR><BR>Drops were Tank phat lewtz :)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>Silverwing, our first VP dragon killing :)</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>10/14/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3"><img src="/lotd/images/silver%2Ejpg" width="320" height="240" align="left">We Entered VP again and decided it was time to take down a named dragon.  Silverwing was our target.  We moved to a deeper camp in VP and decided it was time for this guy to die =)<BR><BR>Gratz Lords on First VP dragon =)<BR><BR><a href="http://members.shaw.ca/eq-hansol/bigrecent.html">More Screenshots</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>LotD Enters VP</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>10/06/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3"><img src="/lotd/images/vp01%2Ejpg" width="400" height="300" align="left">Today LotD entered VP for the first time.. though no named were up, we got a decent idea of the procedures involved with fighting there/getting there/getting out.. Thanks to everyone in LotD who has worked so hard on their vp keys, it will pay off soon. (and yeah the picture kinda sucks, I'm a Warrior dammit, not like I can back up and get a better angle ;) )</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>CT Dead again Guild only!</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>10/05/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3"><img src="/lotd/images/ct2%2Ejpg" width="320" height="239" align="left">We killed CT again tonight for 1 cloak, 1 shoulders, and 2 Uber tank neck peices.  :)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>Busy night :)</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>09/30/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3">Haveing some fun on a Saturday night, we decided to kill Gore, Talendor and Vindi in a matter of 3 hours and still had some time for some fun in the Tormax throne room for faction :)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
	<td class="second-level-text-bold" width="1%" nowrap>Cazic Thule Dead, Guild only!</td>
	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>09/26/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3"><img src="/lotd/images/ctdead%2Ejpg" width="320" height="240" align="left">Yes, CT dead by Lotd :)  With Low deaths!  Was alot of fun and we hope to do it again soon!<BR><BR>Drops were 2 Cloak of the Fearsome and 1 Pauldrons of Ferocity!<BR><BR><a href="http://pub44.ezboard.com/flordsofthedragon54523frm1.showMessage?topicID=229.topic">More Screenshots</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="date-text" colspan="3">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr bgcolor="#C3C3C3">
