	<td class="second-level-text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
	<td class="date-text" nowrap>09/21/01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
	<td class="second-level-text" colspan="3"><img src="/lotd/images/velk%2Dsept21%2Ejpg" width="320" height="240" align="left">With most mobs down or being taken down after the server reset, we decided to grab Velketor the Sorcerer again. :)<BR><BR><a href="http://members.shaw.ca/eq-hansol/bigrecent.html">More Screenshots</a></td>
</tr>
